From d2cb38903e8b28aa6b0cc6eb696e0fcda239a956 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:34:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Split site into Reading List / Attempts / Notes; smaller text
 and fitted equations on phones

- Tabs at the top of every page (names in _data/sections.yml)
- New Attempts section (_attempts/): one page per idea with dated entries,
  status label, sorted by latest entry; template in _drafts/
- Models renamed to Notes (_models/ -> _notes/, /models/ -> /notes/);
  /models/ redirects to /notes/; notes list links from posts and attempts
- Oct 28 WPI page moved to /attempts/wpi-sbm/ as its first entry
- Phones: root font scaled down (body ~15px), tighter padding, and wide
  display equations shrink to fit (js/fit-math.js)
